### FilmFuse core-api - social graph (friends, requests, blocks, search, suggestions, invites)
# Token: see me.http. Use two accounts (@token and @otherToken) to exercise requests end to end;
# set @otherUserId to the second account's profile id (GET /api/v1/me with @otherToken).
# Cursors are opaque: pass back the previous response's nextCursor; null means the last page.
# Emails (request received / accepted) go through the mock gateway unless FILMFUSE_EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp
# (local Mailpit: http://127.0.0.1:54324).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@otherToken = paste-second-access-token-here
@otherUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Search people: case-insensitive prefix on username or display name, 20 per page (q: 2-50 chars)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/search?q=mo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/search?q=mo&cursor=paste-nextCursor-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search text too short -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/search?q=m
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public profile (friendship state, mutualFriendCount, friendCount). 404 if they blocked you.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a friend request -> REQUEST_SENT (or FRIENDS if they had already asked you). Idempotent.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": "{{otherUserId}}"
}

### Outgoing requests, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/requests?direction=OUTGOING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Incoming requests (as the other account)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/requests?direction=INCOMING
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Accept (as the other account; path id = the requester). 404 if there is no pending request.
# Replace the id with YOUR profile id (the requester).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Decline (as the other account) -> 204, idempotent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Cancel your outgoing request -> 204, idempotent
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/requests/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Friends: close friends first, then closeness, then username
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark as close friend (closeness becomes at least 0.8). 404 if not friends.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "closeFriend": true
}

### Unfriend -> 204, idempotent
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Suggestions: friends of friends by mutual count (limit 1-50, default 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/friends/suggestions?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Block -> 204 (removes friendship and pending requests both ways)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blocks/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Blocked people, most recent first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unblock -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blocks/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an invite link (valid 14 days, reusable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Redeem it as the other account -> you are friends immediately. 400 own / 404 unknown or blocked / 410 expired.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/paste-token-here/redeem
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
